    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73">

                <pb facs="0128" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg44"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72114A/188</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-27T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 27, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3009. Your 4187, August 3. Your despatch No. 4070, August 6.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d73-f1"/> War and Navy Departments have agreed to make payments to
                    the <pb facs="0129" n="45" xml:id="pg45"/> categories of officer prisoners of
                    war specified in the proposal of the German Government in accordance with the
                    terms stated therein, pending a definite solution of this matter at the
                    prisoners of war conference at Berne. The Department instructs you to request
                    Spanish Embassy at Berlin to inform German Government to this effect. Advise
                        Garrett.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
